  <p>I'm a tech lead at <a href="https://augmodo.com">Augmodo</a>, where I founded the computer vision data platform team. Before that I was a founding engineer at Electric Twin, built ad recommender systems at Yelp, and trained as a physicist. I live in London and work with teams in the US.</p>
  <p>I write about building ML systems in small companies, and about the parts of leading an engineering team that nobody warned me about. If you only read one thing, read <a href="/writing/what-a-cv-data-platform-is">this</a>.</p>

